   "dct:description": "Builds the Docklands 3D model (terrain, water, greens, buildings and parts, roads, railways, tunnels, places, flood defences, riverbed) into area.js, and the Canary Wharf underground detail (basements, indoor ways, level-tagged points, published structures) into under.js, in local metres around E0 537550, N0 180300.",
   "prov:used": [
    {
     "@id": "urn:cwplans:local:data/raw/uk_os_OSTN15_NTv2_OSGBtoETRS.tif"
